| **Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite** (`gemini-3.5-flash-lite`) | Autonomous subagent execution, high-volume data analysis and document extraction, structured JSON parsing | **Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite** or **Gemini 2.5 Flash** |

